{
  "version": 1,
  "_readme": [
    "The maintained list of fal video endpoints. This is the only catalog file a human edits.",
    "endpoint    - fal endpoint id exactly as fal publishes it (the OpenAPI schema is fetched from it).",
    "id          - optional app-internal id when it must differ from the endpoint (Wan keeps its v1.4 ids).",
    "label       - dropdown label. Routes that share a label are grouped by input mode.",
    "family      - dropdown family key. Unknown keys need an entry under families.",
    "sort_order  - position in the dropdown, lower first.",
    "input_modes / video_mode_kind - optional; inferred from the endpoint path when omitted.",
    "overrides   - optional dict merged last, for hand-tuned keys the schema cannot express.",
    "Refresh from Settings, or: python -c \"import nbs; nbs.refresh_fal_catalog()\""
  ],
  "families": {
